{"id":"24694794da0249835c29bcdeedbd42c74cb6a37d","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1233043","title":"为了通过 ChatGPT 的手机验证，花 100 大洋买了一张法国 eSIM","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"Moishine","excerpt":"分享发现 - @Moishine - 可恶的资本主义...不过实名登记，这个法国号码只有一个月的有效期。以后 ChatGPT 如果再让我验证短信，我只好换号了。","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div><p>可恶的资本主义...</p><p>不过实名登记，这个法国号码只有一个月的有效期。以后 ChatGPT 如果再让我验证短信，我只好换号了。</p></div><div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17953599\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/a8eb/0af2/503692_normal.png?m=1781236811\" alt=\"rimworld\" data-uid=\"503692\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/rimworld\">rimworld</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-09 16:40:10 +08:00\">21h 53m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>只有一个月有效期的 esim ，你还不如找个接码平台接个码。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17953606\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/ca6f5a1992d97e0c2b4e8c51ef0a93bc?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"yidev\" data-uid=\"526064\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>2</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/yidev\">yidev</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-09 16:43:58 +08:00\">21h 49m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>注册 whatsapp, 很多国家 gpt 会通过 whatsapp 下发短信./</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17953609\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/20b7/5f31/741706_normal.png?m=1784762342\" alt=\"Moishine\" data-uid=\"741706\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Moishine\">Moishine</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-09 16:46:05 +08:00\">21h 47m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/yidev\">yidev</a> 你是实际操作过吗？据说手机号码没了，WhatsApp 也收不到验证码的🙁我问豆包这样说的</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17953612\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/01b2/1e89/96909_normal.png?m=1711442950\" alt=\"Boyang\" data-uid=\"96909\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Boyang\">Boyang</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-09 16:49:25 +08:00\">21h 44m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>只有一个月有效期为什么不买个长效接码，也是差不多一个月之要几个大洋</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17953649\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9928/b5d8/828838_normal.png?m=1784001361\" alt=\"chjqpmain\" data-uid=\"828838\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>6</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/chjqpmain\">chjqpmain</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-09 17:11:47 +08:00\">21h 21m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>手机验证不代表一定是资本主义吧，大部分国家的每个环节多数都需要 kyc 和企业端备案的， 我们这里绝对是执行最细化，最严格的地方。然后豆包肯定是不会给出用非国内东西的方法的，一是被审核和专门调控过，二是祂这模型早期我体验过，比其他顶膜太能编了，也不能干活，调研后给出的链接都是假链接，还编造祂从一个什么什么内部社群。<br>卡方面的话，其实还是弄个外国的卡好，我反正大部分绑定的是外国实体卡，开了虚拟号码也不用</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17953704\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/3f42/923a/676983_normal.png?m=1782816911\" alt=\"eventlooped\" data-uid=\"676983\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>10</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/eventlooped\">eventlooped</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-09 17:58:32 +08:00\">20h 35m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/Moishine\">Moishine</a> 我买了张 skinny 卡，100 块钱可以一直使用，无月租。<br>但是我注册时候，用的美国家宽 ip ，并没有需要验证手机号码</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17953724\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/80ea/bf4a/550458_normal.png?m=1778643752\" alt=\"aiGPT\" data-uid=\"550458\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>13</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/aiGPT\">aiGPT</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>PRO</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-09 18:13:18 +08:00\">20h 20m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我这边有长效接码，非一次性临时号</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17953806\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/00d9aee4cc89623de67825a2602f4389?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"Ulduar\" data-ui